              "type": "string",
              "const": "dinf"
            },
            {
              "description": "Freeman 1991 multiple-flow-direction: flow shared among all lower neighbours in proportion\nto slope^1.1 — the most diffuse (hillslope wash, wetness); streams come out wide.",
              "type": "string",
              "const": "mfd"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
